;; ORS30 (a) (doc/ORACLE-RECORDS-SURVEY.md, "Proposed (batch 4)"; doc/llvm/LLVM-CROP-SURVEY.md, "As built: LLS31 (a)"): LLVM IR's oracle
;; tier, the steps that run the host's LLVM 23 (the hosts :llvm: llvm-as, opt, lli, FileCheck; :cxx: clang), by hand at a tag (bin/gate
;; --oracle). llvm-live runs repr/llvm's recorded families with the toolchain as the judge (REPR_LLVM_JUDGE=live: clang -c's objects and
;; llvm-as's bitcode of the original and the print byte for byte, opt -passes=verify's verdict, message and whole stderr), each against
;; its record as the own-verdict steps are; llvm-records-verify records every 25th module of test/llvm/ref-opt23.edn and ref-rt23.edn
;; again (bin/repr-llvm records-verify) and compares them entry for entry (another LLVM: moved, reported; a value printed by its address:
;; address), with a crossed pair that must differ. Measured 2026-11-08 on stage 0 (2 threads): roundtrip-llvmtest 1 min 41 s and 0.67 GB,
;; verify-probes under a minute and 0.5 GB, records-verify 21 s and 0.5 GB. The pack rt's families join llvm-live
;; as parts once their records exist (LLS31 (a)'s night): {:part roundtrip-rt} {:part verify-rt} {:part verify-rt-heldout}.
;; Spliced into test/gate/steps.edn's oracle tier by hand (llvm-rt-pack, 2026-11-08): the steps after cpp-lower-oracle, the crops entry
;; :llvm's vector extended, the controls beside the other LLVM steps'.
;;@ steps
  {:name llvm-live :mem-gib 1 :phase :oracle :chain llvm-oracle
   :cmd "env REPR_LLVM_JUDGE=live REPR_LLVM_THREADS=2 bin/repr-llvm check {part}"
   :hosts [:stage0 :llvm :cxx] :never-loads [arbace.j2g] :pins ["test/cpp/corpora.edn"]
   :inputs [:lib-tools :tools :llvm]
   ;; not verify-llvmtest: its record is the tests' own verdicts (LL9a), and live opt judges every module by opt's whole stderr
   ;; (30 of its 792 passes differ there, measured 2026-11-08); opt's answers on it are llvm-records-verify's
   :parts [{:part roundtrip-llvmtest} {:part verify-probes}]
   :summary ["^roundtrip:|^verify-check:|^repr-llvm check|^FAIL" 6]}
  {:name llvm-records-verify :mem-gib 1 :phase :oracle :chain llvm-oracle
   :cmd "bin/repr-llvm records-verify --sample 25"
   :hosts [:stage0 :llvm :cxx] :never-loads [arbace.j2g] :pins ["test/cpp/corpora.edn"]
   :inputs [:lib-tools :tools :llvm]
   :summary ["^records-verify|crossed|^FAIL" 4]}
;;@ crops
         :llvm [llvm-live llvm-records-verify]
;;@ controls
  llvm-live "test/repr/llvm/verify-controls.txt"
  llvm-records-verify {:waived "the records against the live toolchain entry for entry; its crossed pair (one module's live entry under another's record) must differ, ORS7 (a)"}
